          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.28.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kum 28:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kama hamtaki kusikia, na kama hamtaki kuitia moyoni, ili kulitukuza jina langu, asema BWANA wa majeshi, basi nitawaleteeni laana, nami nitazilaani baraka zenu; naam, nimekwisha kuzilaani, kwa sababu hamyatii haya moyoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angalieni, nitaikemea mbegu kwa ajili yenu, nami nitapaka nyuso zenu mavi, naam, mavi ya sadaka zenu; nanyi mtaondolewa pamoja nayo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.3.11+NUM.3.12+NUM.3.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hes 3:11-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nanyi mtajua ya kuwa mimi nimewaleteeni amri hii, ili agano langu liwe na Lawi, asema BWANA wa majeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
